# Blog posts

- Add each post as a folder under `src/content/blog/<slug>/` with `index.md` (or `index.mdx`) plus any images for that post.
- Folder name becomes the URL slug: `my-topic/index.md` → `/blog/my-topic`.
- Colocate images in the same folder (e.g. `hero.png`) and reference them with relative paths.
- Required frontmatter (see `src/content.config.ts`):

```yaml
---
title: 'Post title'
description: 'One-line summary for SEO and listings'
pubDate: 'May 11 2026'
heroImage: './hero.png'  # optional; path relative to this post folder
updatedDate: 'May 12 2026'  # optional
---
```

- Keep site-wide assets (logo, fonts, shared placeholders) in `src/assets/`; do not put post-specific images there.
- Run `npm run dev` and check `/blog`, the post URL, and `/rss.xml`.
- Keep voice consistent with existing posts: practical, first-person, learning-in-public.
